OL,3,GNEWSA'Batman mansion' owner hits back
OL,4,Ain bats row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a vacant Grade I listed
OL,7,Fmansion that appeared in the film
OL,8,FBatman Begins has hit back at a council
OL,9,Fin a row over completing bat surveys.
OL,11,FMentmore Towers, in rural
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, was served a
OL,13,Flisted-building repairs notice in
OL,14,FAugust, urging the owners to carry out
OL,15,Fa survey of the flying mammals and
OL,16,Frepair masonry.
OL,18,FHowever, a spokesman for the country
OL,19,Fhouse, owned by property tycoon Simon
OL,20,FHalabi, said its "own Batman team has
OL,21,Falready been on the case" with surveys
OL,22,Fand ecological investigations.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
