OL,3,GNEWSA'Batman mansion' owner hits back
OL,4,Ain bats row
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Strachan, deputy leader of
OL,7,FBuckinghamshire Council, said the
OL,8,Fauthority's priority was protecting and
OL,9,Fpreserving the "well-loved" building.
